==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 5.33~13.33 seconds<sup>160f~400f</sup>.
*6 [[Croco]]s spawn after 4.67 seconds<sup>140f</sup>, delay 7.33~14.67 seconds<sup>220f~440f</sup>.
*3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 7.33 seconds<sup>220f</sup>, delay 13.33~17.33 seconds<sup>400f~520f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 6~12.67 seconds<sup>180f~380f</sup>.
**5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.


